Please see the updated KPI definitions on the Sales CRM Training site for&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://salescrm.intel.com/kpi-definitions/kpi-definitions-ccg-2/&quot;&gt;CCG&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://salescrm.intel.com/kpi-definitions/kpi-definitions-dcg&quot;&gt;DCG&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://salescrm.intel.com/kpi-definitions/kpi-definitions-iotg/&quot;&gt;IOTG&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Click the links to jump directly to the pages).&lt;br&gt;
You can now easily identify what has changed in each section by looking for the&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;UPDATED WW18&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;banner in each cell.&amp;nbsp; Example below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/wp-content/uploads/UPDATED-Icon-WW18-1.png&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</value>
