    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_KPI_Message</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>KPI Message</shortDescription>
        <value>&lt;p&gt;&lt;font size=2&gt;If your Opportunity or Deal Win Goal does not display the expected KPI(s), please:
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
1. Confirm &lt;b&gt;ANY&lt;/b&gt; changes (e.g. add, remove, edit) to fields that impact KPI mapping were made &lt;b&gt;MORE THAN 24 hours&lt;/b&gt; prior to the above date/time.  
&lt;br&gt;
2. Confirm your Opportunity meets the &lt;a href=&quot;https://saleskpi.intel.com/&quot;&gt;KPI Criteria&lt;/a&gt; by reviewing the appropriate KPI &lt;a href=&quot;https://saleskpi.intel.com/deal/#video&quot;&gt;Deal&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://saleskpi.intel.com/design/#video&quot;&gt;Design&lt;/a&gt; Execution Table &lt;b&gt;AND&lt;/b&gt; your Decision Date is in 2020.
&lt;br&gt;
3. If #1 and #2 are confirmed and there is still no KPI match, please log an &lt;a href=&quot;https://intel.lightning.force.com/lightning/n/Ask_a_Question&quot;&gt;‘Ask A Question’&lt;/a&gt; (AAQ) and select the topic of Sales CRM. Please be sure to provide your Opportunity ID and the KPI that you expected to match for efficient troubleshooting.</value>
    </labels>
