        <fullName>Core_MDF_EventReminder1</fullName>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>It is used to refer in the flow screen to show event reminder content.</shortDescription>
        <value>REMEMBER: Events must meet the highest standards of business ethics and integrity and comply with all applicable anti-bribery laws, including the U.S. Foreign Corrupt Practices Act, the UK Bribery Act, and applicable local laws. You must also read and comply with the important information included in the Events section of the Activities Catalog.

Gifts, meals, entertainment or travel costs may only be provided for a legitimate purpose, such as to promote, demonstrate, or explain products and services and must be reasonable and not lavish. These costs will be evaluated in accordance with guidance published in the Activities Catalog and paid accordingly. In no case will Intel reimburse more than the allowed maximum amounts.</value>
    </labels>
